# Documentation First

Canonical: `AGENTS.md` · `docs/README.md` · `docs/DOCUMENTATION_RULES.md` ·
`docs/project/AI_HANDOFF.md`

## Before asking or inventing

1. Start at `AGENTS.md` → handoff (`AI_HANDOFF`, `PROJECT_CONTEXT`, `NEXT_SESSION`).
2. Open **only** docs for the active area (ADR → architecture/guide → code → tests).
3. Stop when you can act. Never load the whole `docs/` tree.
4. Prefer a link over reproducing doc text.
5. Reuse docs already read in this chat unless they changed or the area changed.

Missing docs → create/update under `docs/` following `DOCUMENTATION_RULES.md`.
Conflicts with code → report honestly; do not silently “fix” either side.
